3. 下方的 MIT 许可证仅适用于本仓库中由本人编写的代码，
   不适用于任何课程原始资料或教程内容。

This repository is a personal learning project. The code is example code
hand-written while following the "黑马程序员" (Bilibili) AI + Java
beginner course, kept as a record of the learning process.

